### ML ETA
POST http://localhost:8086/api/v1/ml/eta/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cityId": "warsaw",
  "vehicleType": "standard",
  "origin": {"lat": 52.2297, "lng": 21.0122},
  "destination": {"lat": 52.2400, "lng": 21.0500},
  "routeDistanceKm": 6.4,
  "hourOfDay": 17,
  "trafficIndex": 1.4,
  "weatherPenalty": 1.1
}

### ML Matching
POST http://localhost:8087/api/v1/ml/matching/rank
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rideId": "ride-123",
  "cityId": "warsaw",
  "vehicleType": "standard",
  "surgeMultiplier": 1.3,
  "candidates": [
    {"driverId":"driver-a","distanceKm":1.2,"pickupEtaMinutes":4.0,"driverRating":4.8,"acceptanceProbability":0.91,"recentCancellationCount":0,"sameDirection":true},
    {"driverId":"driver-b","distanceKm":0.8,"pickupEtaMinutes":3.0,"driverRating":4.5,"acceptanceProbability":0.62,"recentCancellationCount":2,"sameDirection":false}
  ]
}

